{
"content_id": "14424",
"reference_id": 13592,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "2 John 1:2",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "63001002",
"language": "eng",
"review_level": "Professional",
"content": "<p>Christian love comes from understanding the truth. The truth that lives in us is more than just facts or teachings. The truth is the presence of God, who will be with us forever (see <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43014015\" data-end-ref=\"43014017\">John 14:15–17</data>).</p>",
