"index_reference": "63001009",
"language": "eng",
"review_level": "Professional",
"content": "<p><span><em>Anyone who runs ahead without remaining in the teaching</em></span>: To<em> run</em> <em>ahead</em> means to disagree with the apostles&apos; teachings about Jesus Christ and believe things the apostles did not teach. This is a warning to the church not to listen to the false teachers.</p>",
