{
"content_id": "14421",
"reference_id": 13589,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "2 John 1:12",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "63001012",
"language": "eng",
"review_level": "Professional",
"content": "<ul><li><p>The English expression “face to face” has the same meaning as the Greek expression used here, which is literally “mouth to mouth” (see also <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"64001014\" data-end-ref=\"64001014\">3&nbsp;John 1:14</data>).</p></li><li><p><span><em>so that our joy may be complete</em></span>: This means that our relationship with Christ is not only a private experience. We experience the greatest joy when we live in peaceful fellowship with other believers.</p></li></ul>",
